# Utah Design System

This site is built on [@utahdts/utah-design-system](https://designsystem.utah.gov). Before writing UI code, find the UDS pattern for it; only write custom styles for layout UDS doesn't cover.

## Components and markup
- Use UDS CSS classes on plain HTML first: `button button--solid button--primary-color`, `card`, `table table--lines-x`, `tag`, `banner__wrapper banner--inline`, `action-card`, `accent-color-light-background`. UDS React components (`Button`, `Tag`, `Accordion`) are fine but optional.
- Confirm a class exists in `node_modules/@utahdts/utah-design-system/css/` before using it. Don't invent UDS-looking class names.
- Navigation is a link (`<Link>` or `<a className="button ...">`); actions are `<button>`. Never `window.open` from a button.
- External links open in a new tab and include:
  `<span className="utds-new-tab-link-a11y"><span className="visually-hidden">, opens in a new tab</span><span className="utds-icon-after-external-link" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>`
- Use `className` (never `class`) and unique `id`s; don't copy ids from UDS examples.
- The header, main menu, and footer come only from `setUtahHeaderSettings` in `src/App.jsx`. Add menu entries with `buildMenuItem`.

## Styles
- Colors: hex values live only in the theme block of `src/styles/main.scss`. Everywhere else use tokens: `--primary-color(-dark|-light)`, `--secondary-color(-dark|-light)`, `--accent-color(-dark|-light)`, `--gray-color`, `--gray-light-color`, `--gray-3-1-contrast`, `--success-color`.
- Sizes: `--font-size-xs` … `--font-size-7xl`, `--spacing-3xs` … `--spacing-6xl`, `--font-weight-normal|semi-bold|bold|black`, `--radius-small|medium|large|circle`, `--content-width(-narrow|-medium)`.
- New styles go in `src/styles/components/_<block>.scss` (BEM, nested under `.utah-design-system .<block>` when overriding UDS), forwarded from `_index.scss`. No inline `style` except dynamic values such as bar widths.
- Need transparency over an image? Use `color-mix(in srgb, black 70%, transparent)`, not `rgba()`.

```scss
// ❌ font-size: 22px; color: #474747; padding: 20px;
// ✅ font-size: var(--font-size-xl); color: var(--gray-color); padding: var(--spacing-l);
```

## Dashboard data
- Figures come from `src/config/federalFunds.js` (generated by `npm run data`). Never hardcode numbers in components.

## Before finishing
- Run `npm run build`. It runs `npm run lint` (Stylelint, `stylelint.config.mjs`) first and fails on hex colors, `rgb()`/`rgba()`, or px font sizes and spacing. Fix the style; don't add `stylelint-disable` comments.
